heir own features. Clear the dungeons to earn valuable loot and stop enemy spawns on the island's surface. There are over 40 dungeon and maze models in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886220/extras/f0dbf2b4589d6c785c14f8f3c30b9c76.poster.avif?t=1729786476\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886220/extras/f0dbf2b4589d6c785c14f8f3c30b9c76.webm?t=1729786476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886220/extras/f0dbf2b4589d6c785c14f8f3c30b9c76.mp4?t=1729786476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>User-Friendly Interface</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival games often feature numerous mechanics that can be difficult for beginners to understand. That's why we've added hints at various stages of the game. At the start, you can go through a tutorial to learn the basics. Then, as you progress, the game will provide helpful tips. We've also added videos for greater clarity. A comprehensive Wiki is available from the main menu. Even those who have never played a survival simulator will be able to understand the game.</p>",
